;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, it's already 10 o'clock, so shouldn't you go to bed?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2">, in an unusually big-sisterly tone, gently admonished </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">True, however used she is to the place, it does seem dangerous.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2">, though, may be sensing a danger to her own person even more than that.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">'s right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stay here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Night..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tottered out of the living room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Thank goodness..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As I thought, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> had apparently been dreading getting pestered by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please show the two of them the way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, leave it to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? Aren't we all going together?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and the witnesses each take a different path. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">We meet up in front of the grave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Is this a tradition too? Why would you do that?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... why was that again?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... It's so the shinigami won't come after us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Shinigami...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> draws the shinigami to her along the way, so that they don't take the witnesses with them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And I, the one becoming the witch, go alone, so as not to bring </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="けが">impurity</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to the grave."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So the three of us go together, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> each take a separate path alone.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What do you mean by shinigami?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... In Arata, we call the dead shinigami. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's been said since long ago that the shinigami try to take the living away with them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I've heard of evil spirits trying to take living people away with them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... It's a tradition from long ago, so why not go in the mood for a little test of courage?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uh-huh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Still, we're headed to a graveyard, so it's even creepier than the ghost story earlier.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"H-hey, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="5">, are you okay? Aren't you scared?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
　Ahahaha!
{PAUSE ""}
　Like I'd ever believe in something so unscientific―"
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Having gotten that far, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> made an 'oh no' face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She had probably realized she'd said something thoughtless in front of someone who had, after all, grown up in that kind of settlement.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... It's fine, </STYLE>Goto-chan<STYLE ID="4">. If you come along with that kind of lighthearted attitude, it's easier on me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto-chan<STYLE ID="4">... it's a real shame I can't walk with you and protect you, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> smiled as she stepped up to </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Uuh..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was throwing </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="よこしま">wicked</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looks again, but things didn't seem as awkward as they had at first.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Just then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> came back from the kitchen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">It seemed she had finished all the cleaning up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... What will </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> do?</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">It looks like everyone except </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is going to the succession rite?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬腰に手バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Let's see! I'll take a bath! No need for me to go along too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So the ones going to the succession rite are </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and the three of us from Motoki-cho.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, let's head out first. We gotta stagger when we leave, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"We do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah. Same as with tomorrow's thirteenth-year memorial, the rite starts the moment you step out of the house." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"But earlier, <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was drinking, wasn't she? Is that all right? When it's such an important rite..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Sacred sake is required. Inside me, the one who inherits the role of witch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So you always drink before the rite?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... That's right. Drinking so much you can't walk is strictly forbidden, though."</STYLE><PG>
"Somehow... that sounds like an excuse to drink..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... Heh. Alcohol is used in all sorts of rites, after all. I'm sure people long ago did the same, finding some reason or other to drink."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But it seemed almost all the alcohol had left </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s system.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, we're heading out first!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―But there was no answer from inside.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Alright, let's go! The rite's already started!"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
